{"unit_id":"plae-tljg__dsh-review#card-zh","repo":"plae-tljg/dsh-review","commit":"4232e641334972cc55a42d58f3b638cd506a9ae8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-review 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的代码审阅侧栏插件。它通过 Host 端 workspaceReview 远程服务读取会话工作区，并在原生右侧栏或 dsh-better-sidebar 注册审阅页。用户可以按目录检查暂存、未暂存和未跟踪改动及行数差异，查看每轮会话操作、近期提交和文件内容，也可在启用编辑后保存文件。适合希望在 DSH 会话中直接追踪代码变更并浏览工作区文件的开发者。安装需要 DSH web profile 和工作区访问能力；不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.js:55-95"]}
{"unit_id":"plae-tljg__dsh-review#card-en","repo":"plae-tljg/dsh-review","commit":"4232e641334972cc55a42d58f3b638cd506a9ae8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-review adds a review panel to the DSH web sidebar. It reads the session workspace and shows uncommitted changes, edits by conversation round, commits, and files. Users can inspect diffs and optionally edit files. It requires the DSH web profile and workspace access; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.js:55-95"]}
